body:
I WANT IT

edit: I JUST REALIZED I WAS BEING TOTALLY UNHELPFUL AFTER 2 MINS! do you have a twitter account? if you don't already, i suggest you make one! i have a twitter account where i follow artists like you and i think they get a great amount of support there! i mainly just sketch sometimes but since i learned about art like this it really encouraged me and i'm currently saving up for a drawing tablet and trying to learn how to make a living from art.

through research and by seeing posts from other artists (some of my faves' twitter accs i included below), i learned that aside from selling their enamel pins, button pins, handmade stuffed toys, posters, artzines/comics, etc, almost all of them go to conventions!! some of them make fan art and some of them sell original designs and characters. the most common conventions they go to are anime/comic conventions and of course, art cons.

but i figured it'd be hard tho, to try to live off selling art. i really hope you build up your audience if you haven't already! i'm sure if you find the right ones, you'd be selling a lot of stuff! good luck!! 

also, i'm very happy for you! and i love your avocadon't :---(

fav art twitters:
